<title>USA: Fred Meyer to acquire Fox Jewelry Co.</title>
<headline>Fred Meyer to acquire Fox Jewelry Co.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fred Meyer Inc said Thursday it has agreed to acquire Fox Jewelry Co which has 44 jewelry stores located in malls in six states.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the acquisition is expected to be completed by the end of August 1997. More than half of the Fox stores are located in Michigan and Wisconsin malls. The others are located in Indiana, Illinois, Iowa, and Ohio.</p>
<p>Financial details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The acquisition of the 44 Fox stores along with four more mall jewelry stores scheduled to open by the end of August will give Fred Meyer a total of 255 jewelry stores in 18 states.</p>
</text>
